\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Romania - Factors to watch on May 18\b0\par\par\uc2 350 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Mai 2012\par 08:13\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds press digest)\par \par \uc2 BUCHAREST, May 18 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press reports and events to watch which may affect Romanian financial markets on Friday.\par \par \uc2 ECONOMY MINISTER\par \par \uc2 Romania's Economy Minister Daniel Chitoiu holds news conference from 11 GMT.\par \par \uc2 NEW ROMANIA GOVT TO STICK TO PRIVATISATION PLANS\par \par \uc2 Romania's new government will stick to existing timetables for the sale of stakes in state-owned power companies and hopes to achieve dual listings for those slated to go public, its business environment minister said on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 ROMANIA SELLS 699 MLN LEI IN 5-YR T-BONDS\par \par \uc2 Romania sold 699 million lei ($201 million) in 5-year treasury bonds on Thursday, a touch above plan, with the average accepted yield at 6.15 percent, from 6.14 percent at a previous April 19 tender, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed.\par \par \uc2 CEE MARKETS\par \par \uc2 Central European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  slipped on Thursday following the weaker euro, with Poland's zloty bucking the regional trend as investors remained wary of potential \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 NUCLEARELECTRICA\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's state-owned nuclear power plant Nuclearelectrica has called off the selection process for brokers interested to advise on the bourse listing of a 10 percent stake in the firm.\par \par \uc2 The deadline for bids was May 21. The company said it will resume the selection process soon.\par \par \uc2 Ziarul Financiar, Page 4\par \par \uc2 POSTA ROMANA RESTRUCTURING\par \par \uc2 The managing board of Romania's state-owned postal service Posta Romana will discuss on Friday the restructuring plan for the company that includes more than 1,000 jobs cut.\par \par \uc2 Jurnalul National, Page 11\par \par \uc2 NOTE- For a diary of forthcoming Romanian events, double click, and a calendar of east European economic indicators, see.\par \par \uc2 For other related news, double click on: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ---------------------------------------------------------------\tab \par Romania Market Debt       Romanian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       \tab \par Romania Market Report       Romanian money      \tab \par Emerging Market Debt    Emerging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     \tab \par All Emerging Markets news   CEE indicators  \tab \par All East Europe News         E.Europe equities     \tab \par TOP NEWS -- Emerging markets   \tab \par TOP NEWS -- Convergence watch  \tab \par Romanian indicators        \tab \par Main page of Reuters poll  \tab \par ---------------------------------------------------------------\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 G | RBN | ABN | M | RDN | REVU | E | D | RNP | DNP | PGE   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120518e85i0008n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
