\par\par \b \uc2 DJ  \highlight22\uc2 Romania Forex \highlight\uc2  Reserves Fall In November After  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  -Mediafax\b0\par\par\uc2 215 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Dezember 2011\par 14:46\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2011, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--Romanian \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves fell to EUR31.74 billion in November from EUR32.2 billion a month earlier, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed Friday, in the wake of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the leu.\par \par \uc2 Market participants attributed the decline in reserves to repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in an effort to prevent the leu from weakening too much against the euro. They estimate the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold over EUR200 billion in the first half of November to prop up the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  inflows rose to EUR1.1 billion in November, from EUR383 million in October. Total outflows reached EUR1.55 billion, down from EUR1.8 billion the previous month.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gold holdings were steady at 103.7 metric tons, but their value adjusted for international gold prices increased to EUR4.27 billion, from EUR4.1 billion in October.\par \par \uc2 Romania's overall international reserves totaled EUR36.02 billion in November, down from EUR36.3 billion a month earlier.\par \par \uc2 The payments due on public and publicly guaranteed external debt in December amounted to EUR108.3 million, the data showed.\par \par \uc2 Agency website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.mediafax.ro"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.mediafax.ro }}}\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 December 02, 2011 08:46 ET (13:46 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020111202e7c2003gh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
