\par\par \b \uc2 Romania - Factors to Watch on Sept 15\b0\par\par\uc2 327 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 2010\par 08:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 BUCHAREST, Sept 15 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press reports and events to watch which may affect Romanian financial markets on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 LEU\par \par \uc2 Romania's leu <EURRON=> outperformed central European peers on Tuesday to trade 0.7 stronger on the day, with dealers citing covert \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as being behind the move.\par \par \uc2 [ID:nLDE68D0W7]\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ROMANIA\b0 \highlight\uc2  UNEMPLOYMENT FLAT AT 7.4 PCT IN AUG\par \par \uc2 Romania's unemployment rate was unchanged at 7.4 percent last month, the employment agency said on Tuesday, supported by seasonal effects in construction and farming.\par \par \uc2 [ID:nnLDE68D1WM]\par \par \uc2 EU THREATENS ACTION AGAINST FRANCE OVER ROMA\par \par \uc2 The European Union threatened France with legal action over its handling of the expulsion of Roma migrants on Tuesday, with the EU's justice commissioner calling France's behaviour unacceptable and a disgrace.\par \par \uc2 [ID:nLDE68D11W]\par \par \uc2 HUNGARY JOINS AZERI GAS SUPPLY PROJECT\par \par \uc2 Hungary along with Azerbaijan, Romania and Georgia has signed an agreement to proceed with the Azerbaijan-Georgia-Romania Interconnector (AGRI) gas project, the Hungarian government said on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 [ID:nLDE68D0WA]\par \par \uc2 SMITHFIELD\par \par \uc2 The Romanian unit of pork producer \uc2 Smithfield Foods Inc\uc2  said its sales dropped 3 percent in May-July from the same period of last year to $46.6 million.\par \par \uc2 Ziarul Financiar, page 13\par \par \uc2 NOTE- For a diary of forthcoming Romanian events, double\par \par \uc2 click [RO/DIARY], and a calendar of east European economic indicators, see [CONV/DIARY].\p