\par\par \b \uc2 Romania - Factors to Watch on March 29\b0\par\par\uc2 395 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2010\par 08:15\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, March 29 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press reports and events to watch which may affect Romanian financial markets on Monday.\par \par \uc2  INTEREST RATES\par \par \uc2  Romania's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  holds rate-setting meeting and analysts widely expect it to lower borrowing costs by 50 basis points to 6.5 pct.\par \par \uc2  IMF-MANDATED\par \par \uc2  Parliament could approve an IMF-mandated fiscal responsibility law meant to improve the efficiency of budget spending. Under Romania's IMF deal, the bill must pass by the end of March. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ROMANIA\b0 \highlight\uc2  LEU FALLS, DEALERS CITE CBANK \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu fell 0.3 percent against the euro on Friday as dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  covertly in the market to curb the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which hit 14-month highs this week.\par \par \uc2  [ID:nLDE62P0OO]\par \par \uc2  ROMANIA REPORTS BIRD FLU OUTBREAK NEAR UKRAINE\par \par \uc2  Romania has identified a potential outbreak of bird flu in an isolated village close to Ukraine and has taken measures to prevent spreading, the national sanitary-veterinary authority said in a statement.\par \par \uc2  TECHNICAL UNEMPLOYMENT\par \par \uc2  About 14,000 employees from Romania's state-owned lignite-fired energy holding SNLO and from the Turceni and Rovinari power plants will be sent into technical unemployment until April 11 due to a drop in power demand.\par \par \uc2  Evenimentul Zilei, Page 9\par \par \uc2  BUDGET REVISION\par \par \uc2  A budget revision will take place in May or June, after an IMF mission will visit Romania, news agency Mediafax said, quoting sources.\par \par \uc2  Romania Libera, Page 7\par \par \uc2  MINING LAYOFFS\par \par \uc2  The State-owned operator of Romania's hard coal mines, the biggest debtor to the budget, will lay off 1,600 miners as of April 1, Economy Minister Adriean Videanu said.\par \par \uc2  Romania Libera, Page 7\par \par \uc2  NOTE- For a diary of forthcoming Romanian events, double\par \par \uc2  click [RO/DIARY], and a calendar of east European economic indicators, see [CONV/DIARY].\par \par \uc2  For other related news, double click on: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ---------------------------------------------------------------\par  Romania Market Debt     [RO-DBT]   Romanian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       [RO-FRX]\par  Romania Market Report   [ROL/]     Romanian money      [RO-M]\par  Emerging Market Debt    [EMRG/DBT] Emerging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     [EMRG/FRX]\par  All Emerging Markets news [EMRG]   CEE indicators  [CONV/DIARY]\par  All East Europe News       [EEU]   E.Europe equities     [.CEE]\par  TOP NEWS -- Emerging markets   [TOP/EMRG]\par  TOP NEWS -- Convergence watch  [TOP/EAST]\par  Romanian indicators        [RO/ECI]\par  Main page of Reuters poll  <RO/POLL1>\par  ---------------------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 LANGEN|RDN|REVU|G|RBN|GNN|ABN|E|U|RNP|DNP|PGE|PCO|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100329e63t000at\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
