\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  leu firms vs euro, dealers cite cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 346 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 2009\par 15:51\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 BUCHAREST, Jan 13 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu regained some ground against the euro on Tuesday after falling nearly 1 percent to hit an all-time low earlier in the session, with dealers citing covert \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The leu has been the most battered \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in central and eastern Europe so far this year as investors sold it rapidly on the back of concerns about vast budget and current account deficits while the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained sidelined.\par \par \uc2 They said the bank had been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly before Christmas to keep the leu below 4.0, but it stopped afterwards.\par \par \uc2 "It started again," one dealer said. "It \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  through several banks at around 4.35 per euro and it brought it below 4.3 and after that some players stopped losses, which has pushed it at 4.25."\par \par \uc2 At 1402 GMT, the leu <EURRON=> traded at 4.2542 per euro, compared to an all-time low of 4.3530 hit earlier in the session. The unit was up 1.5 percent on the day.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment on the talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  gives very rarely comments on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  subject," Adrian Vasilescu, an adviser to \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Mugur Isarescu, told Reuters. "We have no comment."\par \par \uc2 Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  with small volumes, but it breathed some life into the market and trading intensified.\par \par \uc2 "Everybody was expecting this moment, players were interested to see how far the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would let the leu fall," another dealer said. "Things are more clear now, I expect the leu to shy away from record lows for the rest of this week."\par \par \uc2 Most \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders said Tuesday's inflation data, which beat market expectations, had little impact on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Prices rose 6.3 percent in December, from 6.7 percent in the previous month and compared with the 6.6 percent consensus. (Reporting by Marius Zaharia; Editing by Victoria Main)\par \par \uc2 ROMANIA-LEU/|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RDN|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090113e51d00187\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
