\par\par \b \uc2 Romania - Factors to Watch on Oct 15\b0\par\par\uc2 329 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 2008\par 08:18\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 BUCHAREST, Oct 15 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press reports and events to watch which may affect Romanian financial markets on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 TEACHERS WAGES\par \par \uc2 Romania's Constitutional Court meets to discuss a parliament decision to increase teachers' wages by a hefty 50 percent, a move that the government said it is discriminatory and endangers macroeconomic stability, and thus, unconstitutional.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, trade unions in the education sector hold a rally in capital Bucharest to demand the immediate implementation of parliament's decision.\par \par \uc2 Agerpres\par \par \uc2 ROMANIA C.BANK READY TO CURB BIG LEU SWINGS\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to counter large swings in the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , governor Mugur Isarescu said on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 [ID:nBUC001157]\par \par \uc2 ROMANIA C.BANK SAYS GOVT SHOULD RUN LOW BUDGET GAPS\par \par \uc2 Romania should run very low or even balanced government budget deficits in the future to safeguard its emerging economy, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Mugur Isarescu said on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 [ID:nBUC001158]\par \par \uc2 ROMANIA'S BRD JAN-SEPT NET PROFIT UP 52.2 PCT\par \par \uc2 Nine-month net profit at BRD , Romania's second largest bank controlled by France's \uc2 Societe Generale\uc2  , grew more than half, boosted mainly by the sale of a stake in insurer Asiban to French insurer \uc2 Groupama\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 [ID:nLE715517]\par \par \uc2 NOTE - For a diary of forthc