\par\par \b \uc2 Romania - Factors to Watch on September 5   \b0\par\par\uc2 506 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 September 2007\par 08:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 BUCHAREST, Sept 5 (Reuters) - Here are news stories, press reports and events to watch which may affect Romanian financial markets on Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 GOVERNMENT MEETING   \par \par \uc2 The government holds its weekly meeting. One of the issues on the agenda is the approval of the winter energy programme.   \par \par \uc2 It may also announce striking a deal with  \uc2 Ford Motor Co\uc2  to sell the state's majority stake in troubled carmaker  \uc2 Automobile Craiova SA.\par \par \uc2 ROMANIAN DIPLOMACY MEETING   \par \par \uc2 Final day of the Romanian Diplomacy Annual Meeting.   \par \par \uc2 ECONOMIC GROWTH SLOWS TO 5.6 PCT IN Q2   \par \par \uc2 The Romanian economy grew by a lower-than-expected 5.6 percent in the second quarter of 2007, signalling a growth slowdown in the country's first year of European Union membership.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL04370439]   \par \par \uc2 ROMANIA RECORDS FISCAL SURPLUS IN JAN-JULY   \par \par \uc2 Romania's consolidated budget recorded a surplus in the first seven months of this year equal to 0.5 percent of gross domestic product, finance and economy ministry data showed on Tuesday.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL04421476]]   \par \par \uc2 ROMANIAN LEU HITS ALMOST 4-MONTH LOW VS EURO   \par \par \uc2 Romania's leu <EURRON=> fell to its lowest level against the euro in almost four months on Tuesday, sparking talk of potential covert \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL04585412]   \par \par \uc2 INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT DOWN   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's unadjusted industrial output fell by 2.4 percent on the month in July, and recorded a 7.1 percent year-on-year rise, statistics office data showed on Tuesday.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL04791112]   \par \par \uc2 CARREFOUR SALES BOOM   \par \par \uc2 Carrefour Romania, the local unit of French retailer Carrefour , posted a year on year rise of 43.8 percent in the first half, up to 361.9 million euros.   \par \par \uc2 Ziarul Financiar, page 1   \par \par \uc2 ROMPETROL SHARE DEALS CLEAN   \par \par \uc2 A probe into the share deals of three Bucharest-listed companies owned by  \uc2 Rompetrol Group NV\uc2 , struck on the day it announced it sold a majority stake, found nothing amiss, the capital market watchdog said on Tuesday.   \par \par \uc2 [ID:nL04764753]   \par \par \uc2 SOCIAL DEMOCRATS TO NEGOTIATE MOTION AGAINST GOVT   \par \par \uc2 Romania's powerful opposition Social Democrat party will launch negotiations with other political groupings on a plan to submit a no confidence vote against the centrist minority cabinet.   \par \par \uc2 Cotidianul, page 9   \par \par \uc2 ELECTORAL CHANGES READY BY SEPT 28   \par \par \uc2 Romania's senate head Nicolae Vacaroiu said he estimated the assembly will approve a law to change the current electoral system by Sept. 28.   \par \par \uc2 Gandul, page 4   \par \par \uc2 NOTE - For a diary of forthcoming Romanian events, double click [RO/DIARY], and a calendar of east European economic indicators, see [CONV/DIARY].   \par \par \uc2 For other related news, double click on:    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ---------------------------------------------------------------\par  Romania Market Debt     [RO-DBT]   Romanian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       [RO-FRX]\par  Romania Market Report   [ROL/]     Romanian money      [RO-M]\par  Emerging Market Debt    [EMRG/DBT] Emerging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     [EMRG/FRX]\par  All Emerging Markets news [EMRG]   CEE indicators  [CONV/DIARY]\par  All East Europe News       [EEU]   E.Europe equities     [.CEE]\par  TOP NEWS -- Emergin